Call a streak of lightning on your target, dealing [83, 112, 134, 153, 169 (TL1-5; MP 100)] to [249, 335, 402, 458, 508 (TL1-5; MP 100)] lightning damage.

If it is wet the lightning propagates to all foes in radius [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)], doing the same damage to each.

All affected foes are seared for 4 turns, reducing their fire resistance by [15%, 23%, 29%, 35%, 40% (TL1-5)] and and mind save by [15, 23, 29, 35, 40 (TL1-5)].

The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
